# BUG-005 — Last Name Field Does Not Accept Input

## Summary

When logged in as `error_user`, the Last Name field on the Checkout Information page does not accept user input.

## Environment

| Item | Details |
|------|---------|
| Application | SauceDemo Web Application |
| User | error_user |
| Browser | Google Chrome |
| Operating System | Windows 11 |
| Test Type | Functional Testing |

## Preconditions

- User is logged in as `error_user`.
- A product is available in the Shopping Cart.

## Steps to Reproduce

1. Log in using `error_user`.
2. Add a product to the Shopping Cart.
3. Click Checkout.
4. Enter a valid First Name.
5. Click the Last Name field.
6. Attempt to enter a valid Last Name.

## Expected Result

The Last Name field should accept and retain the entered value.

## Actual Result

The Last Name field does not accept user input.

